elvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Spotify发布Studio桌面端应用，正式进军生成式音频平台领域</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 正式发布 ChatGPT for PowerPoint 插件，支持一键生成与逻辑纠错</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Comscore发布3月美国桌面端AI榜单：ChatGPT居首，Claude环比增长130%</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">智谱发布GLM-5.1高速版API，实现400 tokens/s推理速度</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2baaa58d47b95d420ecac165763f6ef0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">智谱正式发布GLM-5.1高速版API（GLM-5.1-highspeed），在保持旗舰级模型能力的同时，将输出速度提升至400 tokens/s，刷新全球大模型官方API速度上限。该模型支持200K上下文窗口，最大单次输出达128K tokens，现已通过智谱MaaS平台向特定企业客户定向开放。技术层面，该版本由智谱GLM团队与TileRT团队联合研发，通过重构推理引擎核心路径、引入动态批处理与KV Cache调度优化，以及基础设施层的集群协同调优，实现了“旗舰级能力”与“极致低延迟”的并存。这一突破旨在解决Coding Agent、实时交互、3D游戏及多智能体并行推演等高频场景下的延迟瓶颈，使企业无需在模型智能度与响应速度之间进行妥协，加速软件生态向Agentic时代升级。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">UCSD研究证实GPT-4.5通过图灵测试，胜率超真人且具备完美伪装能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/69056aa44007a63af553be961b3a49ab.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">加州大学圣地亚哥分校（UCSD）在《美国国家科学院院刊》（PNAS）发表研究，证实现代大语言模型已能通过经典三方图灵测试。在双盲实验中，GPT-4.5在特定人格提示下，被判定为人类的胜率高达73%，超越真人志愿者；开源模型LLaMa-3.1-405B胜率达56%，与人类表现持平。研究指出，AI胜出的关键在于学会了“像人类一样掉链子”，通过模拟幽默感、易错性等社会行为特征实现完美伪装。若缺乏针对性提示，GPT-4.5与LLaMa-3.1的胜率则大幅回落。研究者警告，AI伪装能力的提升将导致网络信任链条断裂，极易被恶意利用于诈骗或舆论操纵。未来，行业需加速部署更严苛的数字身份验证与AI内容防伪机制，以应对AI带来的社会安全风险。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Spotify发布Studio桌面端应用，正式进军生成式音频平台领域</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/23bc11b98e97c11ad59fe1e6f0e8c3d0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在5月21日的2026年度投资者日上，Spotify正式发布独立桌面应用Studio by Spotify Labs，标志其从音频播放器转型为生成式音频平台。该应用内置AI Agent，可连接日历、邮箱与笔记，通过深度整合“大品味模型”（Large Taste Model），根据用户日程与听歌偏好生成定制化“每日简报”或“深度学习播客”。Studio支持跨设备同步，生成的音频可直接保存至Spotify Library。相比现有AI播客工具，Studio依托Spotify二十年积累的听觉行为数据，在情绪匹配度上具备显著优势。目前，该应用已在20多个国家和地区开启小范围研发预览测试，面向18岁以上用户开放。Spotify联合CEO Gustav Söderström表示，未来核心竞争力在于理解用户与生成体验，Stu</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 正式发布 ChatGPT for PowerPoint 插件，支持一键生成与逻辑纠错</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/29f544e819c801a31e134d098bfbc4a8.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">5月22日，OpenAI 正式推出 ChatGPT for PowerPoint 插件（Beta版），该插件已嵌入 PowerPoint 底层架构，面向全球所有 ChatGPT 用户（含免费账号）开放。该工具支持三大核心场景：通过自然语言指令一键生成 PPT 初稿；对现有页面进行文案润色与配色调整；以及主动识别内容逻辑缺口并预判汇报提问的“揪Bug”功能。为保障安全性，插件引入了“人在回路（Human-in-the-loop）”机制，针对结构大改等关键操作需用户确认后方可执行。此次原生接入打破了以往 AI 生成内容需手动复制粘贴的割裂体验，标志着办公生产力工具从“手动绘图”向“智能体协作”模式转型，用户现可通过 PowerPoint 插件商店搜索并激活使用。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Comscore发布3月美国桌面端AI榜单：ChatGPT居首，Claude环比增长130%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/97e0da57e2103d5ec8cf42c69e3ccbf6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Comscore发布2026年3月美国桌面端AI聊天机器人市场报告，全美消费级AI平台独立用户达4440万，环比增长超21%。OpenAI旗下ChatGPT以3386万独立访客稳居榜首，环比增长18.9%。谷歌Gemini以1066万访客位列第二，环比增长29.1%；微软Copilot以502万访客位居第三，环比增幅达44.4%。Anthropic旗下Claude表现最为亮眼，以266万独立访客位列第四，环比猛增130.1%，增速居榜首。此外，X Grok、DeepSeek及Perplexity分别以165万、41万和36万独立访客位列榜单第五至第七名。数据表明，尽管ChatGPT保持领先，但以Claude为代表的后方梯队正以高增速迅速缩小差距，桌面端AI市场渗透率持续提升，竞争格局日趋激烈。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
